991","synopsis":"Wu Daoying si trova insieme alla sua nuova amica a combattere contro un'antica tartaruga. Il misterioso uomo che credeva essere responsabile della scomparsa dei bambini si unirà a lui per sconfiggere il pericolo e gli darà il coraggio di lasciare il suo ruolo."},{"title":"Episode 3","episodeNumber":3,"sourceEpisodeNumber":3,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18919","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"137696","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"mal","id":"49757","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"454517","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]}],"link":"86131","synopsis":"Wu Daoying hasn't been traveling for long with Qing Xuan, his new travel companion and teacher, and they already encounter two female bandits along their way. However, it seems the bandits are after more than just their valuables…"},{"title":"Episode 4","episodeNumber":4,"sourceEpisodeNumber":4,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18919","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"137696","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"mal","id":"49757","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"454517","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]}],"link":"86132","synopsis":"Wu Daoying persuades Silberhorn to make a deal with him so that her wish can be fulfilled. But the plan unfolds very differently than she had imagined."},{"title":"Episode 5","episodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18919","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"137696","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"49757","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"454517","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]}],"link":"86324","synopsis":"Qing Xuan and Wu Daoying arrive in the city of Xi An, searching for the Sarira. But even here, things aren't going smoothly…"},{"title":"Episode 6","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"exter